node_modules/
# .claude/ is local config, EXCEPT the Lead's operating contract, which is
# version-controlled on purpose: it encodes owner authority rules (approval
# ordering, the self-modification gate) that must be reviewable and revertible.
# Re-including it takes un-excluding each parent directory in turn -- a bare
# "!.claude/skills/lead-tick/SKILL.md" has no effect while .claude/ itself is
# excluded, which is why the file was previously tracked only via a forced add.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/lead-tick/
.claude/skills/lead-tick/*
!.claude/skills/lead-tick/SKILL.md
.claude-relay/
.clay/
ref/
TODO.md
publish.sh
docs/roadmaps/planned/PILOT-MCP-SERVER.md
.gstack/

# Clay (local task launchers, sessions, settings)
localAIConfig/
